<title>FRANCE: Pernod set to buy Spain's Larios - paper.</title>
<headline>Pernod set to buy Spain's Larios - paper.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's Pernod-Ricard is about to buy Larios of Spain from the Gonzales-Gallarza and Villavincencio families as well as from Banco Central Hispano for 1.4 billion francs, the Les Echos newspaper said.</p>
<p>The paper said Pernod-Ricard declined comment.</p>
